{"seq":1,"slug":"zoonoses-disease-control","title":"大学兽医学 — 人畜共患病与传染病防控","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/public-health-husbandry/zoonoses-disease-control","wordCount":1941,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学兽医学-人畜共患病与传染病防控\">大学兽医学 — 人畜共患病与传染病防控</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>人畜共患病（zoonoses）是指能在动物与人类之间自然传播的疾病。这是兽医最重大的社会责任所在——据世界卫生组织估计，全球约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span> 的已知人类传染病和约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">75\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75%</span></span></span></span></span> 的新发传染病源自动物。从狂犬病、布鲁氏菌病，到禽流感、新冠肺炎，人类历史上许多重大疫情都与动物有关。兽医因此不仅是动物的医生，更是人类公共卫生的&quot;哨兵&quot;和第一道防线。</p>\n<p>防控传染病需要群体的、系统的思维，而非仅仅治好单个病畜。核心工具是流行病学——研究疾病在群体中如何分布、传播和被控制。理解&quot;传染链&quot;的三个环节（传染源、传播途径、易感动物）以及如何切断它们，是制定一切防控策略的理论基础。这种从个体诊疗跃升到群体管理的视角转变，是本章最重要的认知升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"传染链-防控的逻辑起点\">传染链：防控的逻辑起点</h3><p>任何传染病的流行都依赖三个环节构成的&quot;传染链&quot;，切断任一环节即可阻断流行：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[传染源-病畜/带菌者] --&gt; B[传播途径-接触/空气/媒介]&#10;    B --&gt; C[易感动物/人]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|发病后成为新传染源| A\">flowchart LR\n    A[传染源-病畜/带菌者] --&gt; B[传播途径-接触/空气/媒介]\n    B --&gt; C[易感动物/人]\n    C -.-&gt;|发病后成为新传染源| A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>防控措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传染源</td>\n<td>排出病原的动物</td>\n<td>隔离、扑杀、治疗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传播途径</td>\n<td>病原传播方式</td>\n<td>消毒、灭蚊蝇、生物安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>易感群体</td>\n<td>缺乏免疫的个体</td>\n<td>疫苗接种、提高抵抗力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个框架解释了防控的全部逻辑。以狂犬病为例：管理传染源（给犬接种疫苗、控制流浪犬）、切断途径（被咬后及时清创）、保护易感者（暴露后接种疫苗）——三管齐下，狂犬病在许多发达国家已基本消除。但全球每年仍有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.9</span></span></span></span></span> 万人死于狂犬病，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99%</span></span></span></span></span> 由犬传播、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 发生在亚非地区，凸显了犬只免疫这一兽医工作的公共卫生价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"流行病学的关键概念\">流行病学的关键概念</h3><p>理解疫病传播离不开几个量化指标：</p>\n<p><strong>基本再生数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：一个病例在完全易感人群中平均传染的个体数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_0 &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 疫情扩散，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_0 &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 疫情消退。防控的目标就是通过各种措施把有效再生数压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 以下：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>免疫覆盖率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>其他干预系数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{eff} = R_0 \\times (1 - 免疫覆盖率) \\times 其他干预系数</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">免疫覆盖率</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其他干预系数</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>发病率与死亡率</strong>：衡量疾病在群体中的频率和严重性，是评估疫情和防控效果的基本指标。</p>\n<p><strong>潜伏期</strong>：感染到发病的时间，决定了隔离观察期的长短。狂犬病潜伏期长且不定（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个月），这正是被咬后必须立即处理而非&quot;观望&quot;的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重大人畜共患病一览\">重大人畜共患病一览</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>疾病</th>\n<th>病原</th>\n<th>主要动物宿主</th>\n<th>对人危害</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>狂犬病</td>\n<td>狂犬病毒</td>\n<td>犬、蝙蝠</td>\n<td>发病近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span> 致死</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布鲁氏菌病</td>\n<td>布鲁氏菌</td>\n<td>牛、羊</td>\n<td>长期发热、关节痛（牧民职业病）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>禽流感</td>\n<td>H5N1/H7N9 等</td>\n<td>禽类</td>\n<td>高致病株可致命</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弓形虫病</td>\n<td>弓形虫</td>\n<td>猫</td>\n<td>孕妇感染可致胎儿畸形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>炭疽</td>\n<td>炭疽杆菌</td>\n<td>牛、羊</td>\n<td>皮肤/肺/肠炭疽，凶险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>布鲁氏菌病特别值得兽医和养殖者警惕——它是接触感染牲畜的牧民、兽医、屠宰工人的高发职业病，通过接触流产物、饮用生奶传播。防控依赖牲畜检疫、淘汰阳性畜和职业防护。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生物安全-现代养殖的防线\">生物安全：现代养殖的防线</h3><p>对规模化养殖场而言，&quot;防&quot;远胜于&quot;治&quot;。生物安全（biosecurity）是一整套阻止病原进入和扩散的措施体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>隔离</strong>：新引进动物先隔离观察，确认健康再入群。</li>\n<li><strong>消毒与卫生</strong>：车辆、人员、器具进出消毒，&quot;全进全出&quot;清群消毒。</li>\n<li><strong>媒介控制</strong>：灭鼠、灭蚊蝇、防野鸟。</li>\n<li><strong>人员管理</strong>：限制外来人员，工作人员更衣淋浴。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>非洲猪瘟在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2018</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2018</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2018</span></span></span></span></span> 年后给中国养猪业上了惨痛一课。由于没有疫苗和特效药，唯一有效的手段就是极致的生物安全——许多大型猪场把防控做到了&quot;军事化&quot;水平：多重洗消、车辆烘干、饲料高温处理、人员封闭管理。那些生物安全做得好的企业（如部分龙头养殖集团）在疫情中存活并扩张，而忽视防控的散户大量退出，深刻改变了中国养猪业的格局。这是流行病学原理在产业现实中的残酷验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"同一健康-one-health-理念\">&quot;同一健康&quot;（One Health）理念</h3><p>近年来，人、动物、环境健康紧密交织的现实催生了&quot;同一健康&quot;理念——它主张人医、兽医、环境科学跨学科协作，共同应对人畜共患病、抗生素耐药、食品安全等全球挑战。新冠疫情后，这一理念被空前重视。兽医在其中扮演不可替代的角色：监测野生动物和家畜中的潜在新发病原、控制畜牧业抗生素使用、保障食品安全链。理解兽医工作的这一全局意义，是本课时最重要的升华。</p>\n<h3 id=\"疫情应对的真实流程\">疫情应对的真实流程</h3><p>当某养殖场怀疑暴发烈性传染病，标准应对流程是：及时上报 → 现场流行病学调查（追溯传染源和接触史）→ 采样送检确诊 → 划定疫区封锁 → 扑杀和无害化处理病畜 → 全面消毒 → 流行病学追踪和解除封锁。这套程序背后是国家动物疫病防控体系，兽医（尤其是官方兽医）是其执行的中坚。理解这套流程，就理解了为什么一次基层兽医的及时警觉，可能阻止一场波及全国的疫情。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>传染链的三个环节是什么？以狂犬病为例，说明如何针对每个环节采取防控措施。</li>\n<li>基本再生数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是什么含义？防控措施如何通过降低有效再生数来控制疫情？</li>\n<li>为什么说兽医是人类公共卫生的&quot;第一道防线&quot;？请用人畜共患病的数据和例子支撑。</li>\n<li>非洲猪瘟没有疫苗和特效药，为什么&quot;生物安全&quot;成为唯一有效手段？它包括哪些具体措施？</li>\n<li>解释&quot;同一健康&quot;（One Health）理念，说明兽医在应对全球公共卫生挑战中的独特作用。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>《兽医流行病学》——系统学习疫病的群体防控逻辑</li>\n<li>了解全球狂犬病防控目标&quot;2030 年消除犬传人狂犬病死亡&quot;</li>\n<li>研究非洲猪瘟如何重塑中国养猪业的生物安全标准</li>\n<li>关注&quot;同一健康&quot;在新冠后被各国政府重视的政策动向</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课时完成了从个体诊疗到群体防控的认知跃升。人畜共患病使兽医成为公共卫生的哨兵——全球多数新发传染病源自动物。防控的核心逻辑是切断&quot;传染源—传播途径—易感群体&quot;构成的传染链，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等流行病学指标量化评估。狂犬病、布鲁氏菌病、非洲猪瘟等案例展示了疫苗、生物安全和疫情应对程序的实战价值。&quot;同一健康&quot;理念将人、动物、环境健康视为整体，赋予兽医工作全球意义。下一课时将聚焦另一个公共卫生维度——食品安全与卫生检疫。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学兽医学 — 人畜共患病与传染病防控","id":"大学兽医学-人畜共患病与传染病防控"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"传染链：防控的逻辑起点","id":"传染链-防控的逻辑起点"},{"level":3,"text":"流行病学的关键概念","id":"流行病学的关键概念"},{"level":3,"text":"重大人畜共患病一览","id":"重大人畜共患病一览"},{"level":3,"text":"生物安全：现代养殖的防线","id":"生物安全-现代养殖的防线"},{"level":3,"text":"\"同一健康\"（One Health）理念","id":"同一健康-one-health-理念"},{"level":3,"text":"疫情应对的真实流程","id":"疫情应对的真实流程"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学兽医学 — 麻醉与兽医药理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice/anesthesia-pharmacology"},"next":{"title":"大学兽医学 — 食品安全与现代畜牧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/public-health-husbandry/food-safety-husbandry"}}